      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>D\u0101r\u0101bcird</em>:\u00a0One of the dependencies of <em>F\u0101rs</em> (Fars Province).\u00a0It has walls and a trench, and is a city where the origin of its water sources is clearly visible.\u00a0In its surrounding districts appear mountains of white, red, yellow, green, and black salt.\u00a0They hollow out those mountains and supply salt to the surrounding lands. [translation]</p>",
